WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.522
Hi! To find out who, where or when, we use question words. Today we'll learn question words in English.

2
00:00:09.672 --> 00:00:13.866
To ask about a person, use who: Who is your teacher?

3
00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:17.778
To ask about a thing, use what: What is this?

4
00:00:17.928 --> 00:00:21.882
To ask about a place, use where: Where is my bag?

5
00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:27.186
To ask about a time, use when: When is your birthday?

6
00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:32.394
To ask for a reason, use why. The answer often has because.

7
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:36.090
To ask how, use how: How do you go to school?

8
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:40.506
To ask about a number, use how many: How many apples?

9
00:00:40.656 --> 00:00:46.002
To ask who owns something, use whose: Whose pen is this?

10
00:00:46.152 --> 00:00:50.514
Watch out! In May is a time, so we can't use where!

11
00:00:50.664 --> 00:00:53.418
To ask about a time, use when.

12
00:00:53.568 --> 00:00:57.282
So it's When is your birthday?

13
00:00:57.432 --> 00:01:08.178
Your turn! ___, is that man? The answer is He is my uncle. Which one? Pause and think.

14
00:01:08.328 --> 00:01:13.890
Asking about a person: who. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:24.882
Another one! ___, is the cat? The answer is Under the table. Which one? Pause and think.

16
00:01:25.032 --> 00:01:30.306
Asking about a place: where. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:41.898
Here's another! ___, are you sad? The answer is Because I lost my toy. Which one? Pause and think.

18
00:01:42.048 --> 00:01:47.730
The answer gives a reason: why. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:58.482
Try one more! ___, is in your bag? The answer is A book. Which one? Pause and think.

20
00:01:58.632 --> 00:02:03.858
Asking about a thing: what. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:04.008 --> 00:02:14.778
Try one more! ___, do you go home? The answer is By bus. Which one? Pause and think.

22
00:02:14.928 --> 00:02:20.370
Asking about the way: how. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:31.578
Try one more! ___, legs does a spider have? The answer is Eight. Which one? Pause and think.

24
00:02:31.728 --> 00:02:37.410
Asking about a number: how many. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:48.306
Try one more! ___, is the party? The answer is On Saturday. Which one? Pause and think.

26
00:02:48.456 --> 00:02:53.658
Asking about a time: when. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:53.808 --> 00:03:04.626
Last one! ___, is your bag? The answer is under the desk. Which one? Pause and think.

28
00:03:04.776 --> 00:03:10.049
Asking about a place: where. Did you get it right?

29
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:18.953
Remember: look at what the answer tells you first. A person is who, a place is where, a time is when, and a reason is why.

30
00:03:19.103 --> 00:03:24.593
Ask your family three questions with different question words!

